        "html": "\n    <header class=\"cbt-section-intro\">\n      <span class=\"cbt-kicker\">SECTION 2 · QUESTIONS 11–20</span>\n      <h3>Kinney Hotel</h3>\n      <p>Questions 11–15: Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS</strong> for each answer.</p>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"cbt-note-group\">\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"11\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">11</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>Located in the town centre, near the</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"11\"></span><span>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"12\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">12</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>Rated 4-star by a</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"12\"></span><span>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"13\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">13</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>The most luxurious and expensive room in the hotel is the</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"13\"></span><span>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"14\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">14</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>Has a restaurant specialising in Norwegian</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"14\"></span><span>on ground floor.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"15\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">15</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>Has a special</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"15\"></span><span>on the 15th floor.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <header class=\"cbt-section-intro is-compact\">\n      <span class=\"cbt-kicker\">QUESTIONS 16–20</span>\n      <p>Label the plan below. Write the correct letter <strong>A–G</strong>.</p>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"k56-side-layout k56-map-layout\">\n      <figure class=\"cbt-park-map\" aria-label=\"Ground floor of Kinney Hotel\">\n        <img src=\"assets/kinney-hotel-plan.png\" width=\"1900\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"Ground floor of Kinney Hotel with locations A to G, the elevator, reception and entrance.\">\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"cbt-short-answer-list\">\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"16\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">16</strong><span>Art gallery</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"16\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"17\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">17</strong><span>Fountain</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"17\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"18\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">18</strong><span>Restaurant</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"18\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"19\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">19</strong><span>Bakery</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"19\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"20\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">20</strong><span>Bar</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"20\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"
