        "html": "\n    <header class=\"cbt-section-intro\">\n      <span class=\"cbt-kicker\">SECTION 3 · QUESTIONS 21–30</span>\n      <h3>Student Information</h3>\n      <p>Questions 21–24: Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"cbt-form-card\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row is-example\"><span>Name</span><span>Denise Gough</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row\"><span>Faculty</span>\n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"21\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">21</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"21\"></span>\n    </span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row\"><span>Phone number</span><span>8918220</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row\"><span>Address</span><span>\n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"22\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">22</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"22\"></span>\n    </span>, Ennis</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row\"><span>Previous jobs</span><span>private tutor<br>\n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"23\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">23</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"23\"></span>\n    </span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row\"><span>Skills</span><span>fluent in Polish and \n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"24\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">24</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"24\"></span>\n    </span><br>can play the violin</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-form-row\"><span>Special interests</span><span>sport; videogames</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <header class=\"cbt-section-intro is-compact\">\n      <span class=\"cbt-kicker\">QUESTIONS 25–30</span>\n      <p>Complete the table. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"cbt-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"cbt-data-table\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Job vacancy</th><th>Important details</th><th>Schedule</th><th>Main problems</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>\n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"25\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">25</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"25\"></span>\n    </span></td><td>check if customers are over the drinking age</td><td>8 pm–2 am<br>\n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"26\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">26</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"26\"></span>\n    </span></td><td>too late at night</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>violin teacher</td><td>take care of \n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"27\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">27</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"27\"></span>\n    </span></td><td>6 pm–8 pm every weekend</td><td>student hates \n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"28\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">28</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"28\"></span>\n    </span></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>\n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"29\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">29</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"29\"></span>\n    </span> for a game developer</td><td>having a \n    <span class=\"cbt-answer-control\" data-question-number=\"30\">\n      <strong class=\"cbt-blank-number\">30</strong>\n      <span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"30\"></span>\n    </span> is a major bonus</td><td>flexible (except for Monday)</td><td>too far from home</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>"
