        "html": "\n    <header class=\"cbt-section-intro\">\n      <span class=\"cbt-kicker\">SECTION 4 · QUESTIONS 31–40</span>\n      <h3>Winchester Haunted House</h3>\n      <p>Questions 31–34: Write <strong>NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"cbt-note-group\">\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"31\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">31</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>The attraction was inspired by</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"31\"></span><span>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"32\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">32</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>It is located in the</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"32\"></span><span>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"33\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">33</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span></span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"33\"></span><span>are not allowed to enter.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card cbt-sentence-card\" data-question-number=\"34\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\">\n        <strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">34</strong>\n        <p class=\"cbt-sentence-question\"><span>It is closed on</span><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"34\"></span><span>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <header class=\"cbt-section-intro is-compact\">\n      <span class=\"cbt-kicker\">QUESTIONS 35–40</span>\n      <p>Which feature is found in each room? Choose the correct letter <strong>A–H</strong>.</p>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"k56-side-layout k56-answers-left\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-option-bank\">\n        <p><strong>A</strong> a religious tradition of resurrecting the deceased</p>\n        <p><strong>B</strong> a horror story told by people in China</p>\n        <p><strong>C</strong> an investigator pursuing a notorious criminal</p>\n        <p><strong>D</strong> an abandoned hospital in England</p>\n        <p><strong>E</strong> a true origin mistaken by many people</p>\n        <p><strong>F</strong> the house of a young girl brutally killed by a gun</p>\n        <p><strong>G</strong> special sound effects</p>\n        <p><strong>H</strong> a murderer confronting the spirits of his victims</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-short-answer-list\">\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"35\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">35</strong><span>Asylum</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"35\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"36\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">36</strong><span>Tomb</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"36\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"37\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">37</strong><span>Operation room</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cbt-answer-row\"><span class=\"cbt-inline-answer\" data-answer-slot=\"37\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div class=\"cbt-question-card\" data-question-number=\"38\">\n      <div class=\"cbt-question-heading\"><strong class=\"cbt-question-number\">38</strong><span